WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.418
There's a civil war on the horizon

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:02.961
that you probably don't know much about.

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:03.586
It's happening

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:05.046
in Sudan, a resource

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.673
rich country in Africa.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.258
Other countries in the region

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:09.259
and from far away

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:11.136
are taking notice of this war, partly

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:13.388
because Sudan is strategically located

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:13.930
right here

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:14.848
on the Red Sea,

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.641
where more than 10% of the world's

00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:17.976
trade passes through.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:18.852
Sudan's massive

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.311
gold and mineral resources

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:22.897
are also useful for making electronics.

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:24.733
And if neighboring countries like Egypt,

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.860
the UAE and Libya get involved,

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.778
this conflict could get worse.

